    "method": "Select independently qualified BIFF8 number plaintext stream with FILEPASS. Replace its verifier using the listed password bytes and fixed original salt; hash nonce bytes16..31, encrypt nonce+hash continuously using block0. Independently hash password/salt and use PyCryptodome ARC4 for each absolute1024-byte block; retain framed/exempt records and BoundSheet first4bytes. XOR uses pinned msoffcrypto password key/array/verifier and inverse byte rotation. Fresh oracle decrypts every encrypted payload byte exactly to original plaintext. Fixtures contain only synthetic public test passwords.",
    "xorOracleSha256": "3611442f88e0e36e4c72bc77d1d45232b9e33ce7367fd2f1f4a66fbb51654387",
